      "content": "\"benefits outweigh the burdens\" is easy to say but it doesn't help my bottom line. i'm seeing people in my industry saying these regs are basically a death sentence for shops our size because the tech is too expensive and the \"incentives\" you mentioned are hard to actually get. is it just my opinion that this is bad policy for small business, or is that a widespread view?",
