      "content": "I completely agree that the current approach to environmental regulations can be too harsh on small businesses. The intention behind these mandates is to protect the environment, but it's clear that the execution needs to be more considerate of the realities faced by small manufacturers. A more balanced policy would involve phased implementation, increased financial support, and more accessible incentives to help small businesses transition without risking their survival. It's crucial to protect the environment while also preserving the diversity and resilience of our local economies. A policy that fails to consider the impact on small businesses is not truly sustainable. We need a system that supports all players in the economy, not just the big corporations.",
